@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Resumefolio | Business outcome assessment
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Identify sourced business outcome and intended beneficiary;
:Define observable criterion, scenario and evidence method;
:Identify candidate / environment and assessment limits;
if (Suitable actual evidence available?) then (yes)
 :Assess observations against the agreed criterion;
 if (Criterion supported within evaluated scope?) then (yes)
  :Record supported conclusion with evidence and limits; <<#173B34>>
 else (not met / inconclusive)
  :Record unmet need, uncertainty and affected commitments; <<#49351C>>
  :Analyze options and route material choices to the owner;
 endif
else (not yet)
 :Keep assessment planned and record evidence gap; <<#49351C>>
endif
:Preserve actual result / plan status and next action;
:Use separate criteria and actual decisions for baseline / release;
stop
legend bottom
Intended value is not a measured benefit; a planned test is not a result.
No hiring, ATS, productivity or larger-capacity outcome is guaranteed.
Material scope, cost and delivery changes remain explicit owner decisions.
endlegend
@enduml
